   "issues": [
    "Source 'Heal ... naturally' rendered as 'help improve naturally' (帮助改善) to avoid strengthening into a cure-type claim; 'Kairali Healing Village' rendered with the approved term 阿育吠陀疗愈村."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5d13f2c249db4f1bbe2a",
   "sourceHash": "5d13f2c249db4f1bbe2a4b773412428ccb932cc83aa59107aa9286199c96b53a",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]面瘫与神经康复疗法[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_52e2a9a87c062d477130",
   "sourceHash": "52e2a9a87c062d477130aa24879f8c76da01131c40bd097d38ef4698f423305f",
   "text": "面瘫常由神经阻塞、感染或损伤等因素引起，会导致面部功能丧失。该病症可引发多种症状，如无力、麻木、疼痛及言语困难。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3da53e0c83e628f37ad",
   "sourceHash": "f3da53e0c83e628f37ad53acf65b33c1d5c3d8b8e7bc9af6417a79f4d882ddae",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 提供的面瘫阿育吠陀治疗，旨在恢复平衡并调理加重的瓦塔（Vata）。治疗中使用草药来减轻面部肿胀和疼痛，同时通过特制片剂、choornam（药粉）和酥油制剂来促进血液净化并增强脑功能。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_616e03f6d293652e83f5",
   "sourceHash": "616e03f6d293652e83f536ed71b04c640255a6553d41622c9ff48ed3ba923d01",
   "text": "以阿育吠陀方式自然调治面瘫的疗程为 14/21/28 天，包括 Thalam（塔拉姆）、Nasyam（鼻疗）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）、Pichu（皮丘）、Sirovasti（头部油浴）、Podikizhi（药粉包敷）和 Ksheeradhoomam（乳蒸疗法）等疗法。其他康复疗法将根据个人问诊情况量身安排。疗程中还融入瑜伽与冥想课程，以辅助康复。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b6b243caef1ef4d3b387",
   "sourceHash": "b6b243caef1ef4d3b387fade80bd20f38c2b8beb0b3c2cadd3a7aebd19fe0968",
   "text": "治疗思路",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c54d42777fa3c7820cfa",
   "sourceHash": "c54d42777fa3c7820cfa5f214961a4e6fe36b60c59cbda5179176954db69aacb",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]面瘫与神经康复疗法[[CLOSE_1]]的治疗思路",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a511cf16b7d5e4038170",
   "sourceHash": "a511cf16b7d5e4038170668f8d8a8b5f4f2473c77aedf30cea2beae8448fc14d",
   "text": "在阿育吠陀中，面瘫是一种使人身体功能受损的病症，常由瓦塔（Vata）和皮塔（Pitta）能量失衡引起。在 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village，我们 [[VAR_1]] 多年的经验见证了阿育吠陀治疗带来的显著改变。我们的治疗方式因人而异，着眼于每位患者独特的体质和病史，以针对根本原因。我们采用 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）和 Nasyam（鼻疗）等疗法，以促进神经再生和肌肉恢复活力。Ashwagandha（南非醉茄）、Brahmi（假马齿苋）和 Bala（黄花稔）等药草以及 Rasayana（滋养补益疗法）有助于强化神经系统。我们还重视生活方式和饮食调整，以促进整体健康与康复。阿育吠陀的古老智慧与我们的专业经验相结合，为面瘫康复提供一条可靠而有效的途径。请信赖 Kairali Wellness Retreats，引导您获得持久的积极效果，提升生活质量。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Kairali Wellness Retreats' kept verbatim as a proper name; flag for owner review whether this brand reference is appropriate on a KTAHV clinical page."
   ]
  },
